    "detailed_description": "Classic Roguelike A procedurally generated dungeon that changes shape every time you enter. We prioritize smooth controls and pacing, allowing for stress-free adventures with our special fast-movement feature (known as K-Dash). Whether you prefer to move quickly or take your time, the turn-based system accommodates both playstyles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIdentification System When you use a wand or equip a piercing, the effects are automatically identified if their properties become clear. In the dungeon's shop, simply drop your items on the floor and speak to the shopkeeper, &quot;Panda,&quot; to automatically get the selling price labeled on the items.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3D Models Almost all graphics are original.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKeyboard and Controller Support Some key assignments can be customized through &quot;Settings&quot; \u2192 &quot;Key Configuration.&quot;",
